pageType: cover
background: {type: solid, color: "$bg"}
notes: 开场：上半年整体达标——营收 2,731 万、达成 104%，毛利率站稳 68%。今天用五个视角把"钱从哪来、花到哪去、下半年打哪"讲清楚。
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 42, 520, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: "QINGSHAN COFFEE · 2026 H1 BUSINESS REVIEW"
  - elementId: brand
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 150, 540, 92]
    content:
      fontSize: 54
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      color: "$primaryDeep"
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.1
      text: 青山咖啡
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 244, 540, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 21
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      text: 2026 上半年经营复盘
  - elementId: status
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 312, 560, 66]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.9
      text: |
        <p>H1 营收 <strong>¥2,731 万</strong>（目标达成 104%）　毛利率 <strong>68.0%</strong>（+1.2pct）　会员 <strong>8.6 万</strong>（+31%）</p>
  - elementId: cup-ring
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [662, 128, 248, 248]
    shapeName: donut
    adjustments: [22000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: ring-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [724, 214, 124, 78]
    content:
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:11px; color:$muted;">上半年毛利率</span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:27px; font-family:Source Han Serif CN; color:$primary; font-weight:bold;">68.0%</span></p>
  - elementId: cover-meta
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 452, 560, 76]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      text: |
        <p>汇报：品牌运营部 · 2026 年 7 月</p>
        <p>本报告为多图表能力展示，全部数据为品牌示例数据（虚构）</p>
